# `tools/` itself is tracked: it holds developer tooling that contributors are
# meant to run (the parallel test runner, the docs-guard verifier).  The doctor
# is the exception -- it is a local diagnostic whose ship-or-drop question is
# still open, and shipping it untested would be worse than not shipping it.
tools/seafile_doctor.py

